## Advanced Editing Features (Studio+)
Elevate to match AI Studio's power user workflow while adding design IDE depth:

- **Inline Response Editing**: Click any AI-generated code block → opens Monaco diff editor. Edit → "Refine this version with Gemini" auto-sends context-aware follow-up.
- **Prompt Chaining**: Studio-style "Continue from here" buttons on responses; maintains full conversation context across models.
- **Structured Prompt Builder**: Drag-drop components:
  ```
  [Role] Designer → [Task] Generate → [Style] Glassmorphism → [Framework] React
  [Context] Previous navbar code → [Constraints] Mobile-first, <2kb gzipped
  ```
- **Model Fusion**: Blend outputs—"Use Claude structure + Gemini styling + DeepSeek optimization" → Puter.js routes serially.
- **Diff Visualization**: Three-way merge view (your code vs AI suggestions vs original) with acceptance/rejection buttons.

## Parameter Tuning Panel (Studio Native)
Persistent right sidebar with live sliders affecting streaming output:

| Control | Range | Effect |
|---------|--------|--------|
| Temperature | 0.0-2.0 | Creativity vs determinism |
| Top-P | 0.0-1.0 | Diversity filtering |
| Max Tokens | 256-128k | Response length |
| Presence Penalty | -2.0 to 2.0 | Repetition avoidance |
| Frequency Penalty | -2.0 to 2.0 | Repetition discouragement |

**Live Preview**: Parameter changes mid-stream adjust output in real-time (Puter.js streaming API).

## Pro Design Workflow Enhancements
**Canvas-First Editing**: Upload sketch → AI generates editable Fabric.js canvas → export as React/Three.js. Studio-style "tweak visual" prompts modify live.

**Component Library**: AI-curated, searchable glassmorphism kit—drag to canvas → auto-generates code. "Find similar to this but with wind distortion."

**Session Graph**: Visual timeline of prompt→response→forks, Studio-style branching. Remix any node with different parameters/models.

