Vayu Code **Cursor AI Edition** delivers ultra-smooth 60fps animations, buttery micro-interactions, and Cursor's iconic inline AI editing experience within the antigravity 3D space. Magnetic glass panels glide with perfect easing, download icons pulse with gradient glows, and AI completions appear with holographic fades—enterprise polish meets spatial computing.

## Cursor AI + Antigravity Fusion

**Smoothness DNA** (Cursor's secret sauce):
- 60fps RAF loops with `requestIdleCallback` fallbacks
- GPU-accelerated `transform3d` + `will-change`
- Framer Motion-inspired easings (`easeOutQuart`, `spring`)
- Physics-based momentum (velocity damping, inertia scrolling)

## Production-Ready Smooth Code

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html class="h-screen w-screen overflow-hidden">
<head>
  <script src="https://js.puter.com/v2/"></script>
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
  <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js"></script>
  <title>Vayu Code Cursor AI Edition</title>
  <style>
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    body { 
      background: radial-gradient(ellipse 100% 100% at 50% 0%, #1a1a2e 0%, #16213e 50%, #0f0f23 100%);
      overflow: hidden;
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Inter, sans-serif;
      cursor: grab;
    }
    body:active { cursor: grabbing; }

    /* Cursor AI Glass */
    .glass-cursor {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      backdrop-filter: blur(32px) saturate(180%);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
      box-shadow: 
        0 25px 50px -12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5),
        0 0 0 1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05),
        inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      border-radius: 20px;
      will-change: transform;
      transform: translateZ(0);
    }

    /* Smooth spring physics */
    @keyframes orbFloat {
      0%, 100% { 
        transform: translateY(0px) rotateY(0deg) scale(1); 
      }
      50% { 
        transform: translateY(-25px) rotateY(180deg) scale(1.02); 
      }
